Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've activated the\Nautopilot, so let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love this part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Last one there's got to polish my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a wrap, Balan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing these carvings confirms\Nwhat I suspected all along, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You share a common bond with\Na 5,000-year-old pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that my life's more\Nconfusing than most kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can shed more\Nlight on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've spent the latter part of my\Ncareer studying Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It started as more than a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian sorcerers discovered a way to seal\Nreal monsters away within stone tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They would periodically release these\Nmonsters to display their great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.43,0:02:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As more monsters were collected,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the sorcerers' powers grew stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.25,0:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,until eventually this\Nshadow magic spun out of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,control and threatened to\Ndestroy all life on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But one man was able to face this\Nmadness and turn the darkness to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The great pharaoh whose power\Nyou carry around your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that explain\Nwhat's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did these ancient monsters\Ncome back or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so, but there's another\Npiece to this story you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever hear of the lost city of Atlantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I read a great book about it once. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In my latest expedition, I may\Nhave discovered that very city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An underwater world that existed\Nlong before ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But what really puzzled me were\Nthe carvings I saw on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So these monsters didn't originate\N5,000 years ago in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They lived over 10,000 years ago in what I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,believe to be the\Nlegendary city of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Atlantis was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your discovery could\Ncompletely rewrite history.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still quite a bit I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the monsters\Nare attacking the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look at the picture more closely,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that only some of the\Nmonsters are destroying the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,if only some of these\Nmonsters seem to be evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean that the\Nother monsters are good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't collected enough\Nevidence to confirm that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but I believe there's a parallel world of\Nmonsters that exists alongside our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And throughout history, certain humans\Nhave been able to release these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them have helped mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Others have tried to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, you nutty professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's my grandfather\Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who messes with him messes with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep your comments to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no stranger to ridicule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it is a bit of\Na far-fetched theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.03,0:04:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the weird stuff we've\Nbeen through, I'd believe anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the time I fought\NMaric in that Shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All those monster attacks\Nfelt pretty real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And did you forget the times that both Mai
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and Bakura got blasted\Ninto the Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, there's plenty of stuff\Nout there that can't be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:05:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like how there's a pharaoh\Nliving in my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,our hypothesis suggests that\Nthe supernatural phenomena
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you experience may actually\Nfind its roots in Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those are some pretty big words,\Nespecially coming from such a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a college student,\Nthank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,College student?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My granddaughter is quite gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Grandpa, I'm just your\Naverage child genius. Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, but\Ncan't you spell obnoxious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Rebecca, is that the\Nbehavior of a college student?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Gramps, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the point that I'm\Ntrying to make here is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When Egyptian sorcerers conjured\Nthese monsters 5,000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the pharaoh was there to save\Nmankind from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it seems that pharaoh's\Nbeen reborn in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,which could mean mankind\Nneeds his help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I wouldn't even know\Nwhere to begin, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do we try and get all these\Nmonsters to go back to their own world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should we focus on finding out what\Nthat weird motorcycle gang is up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this is where my\Nknowledge of the situation ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever see anything like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.91,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you got there, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys we dueled against\Nlast night left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone is remarkably similar to\Nsomething I discovered on my expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I held\Non to this stone, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to take it back to my lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling it may hold the\Nanswers to many of our questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You kids, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take Arthur\Nand Rebecca to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-ta!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought things\Nwere getting back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,they went and got ten times weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and this time the situation\Nseems more treacherous than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right there, Yook? Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear someone call for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, this place is a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's been an\Nexhausting day, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go catch some z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,After that story, it's going\Nto be nightmare central for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a world of monsters\Nthat exists alongside our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, all I can think about\Nis what Professor Hawkins said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If his theory about these\Nduel monsters is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,this could be our toughest fight yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We located the Pharaoh Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we weren't\Nable to capture his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to\Ndefeat him this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I never come back empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, I've waited an eternity\Nto hold their power in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally possess the supreme force\Nnecessary to awaken the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we shall rid the earth of mankind\Nand rebuild civilization as it once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Serpents of the Orachalcos,\Nplease hear my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I offer thee the gods of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Use their divine might to unlock the\Nsacred chamber of the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken him from his ancient\Nslumber by accepting my offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has arrived, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after 10,000 years, the\Ngreat leviathan shall rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh! This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever that is, they\Ncould be almost anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Nfind someone in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's way too many doorways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Karibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying to lead us\Nto whoever needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's on the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the sound of my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it appears to be\Nsome kind of kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it\Ndoesn't look too friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see what I see? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of statues made of crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They appear to be dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they're only statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd find me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dark magician, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, why were you\Ncalling out for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, both of our worlds are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And without your help, we\Nwill all cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So Professor Hawkins was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as mankind has walked the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,the dominion of the beasts has existed\Nside by side with the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have lived this way\Nfor thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Although our worlds are separate, we\Ndepend on one another in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But now something is threatening\Nthat survival and it must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A gateway between us has opened and now\Nthe great beast will swallow us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It lives above the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,feasting on the life force of monsters\Nand humans, as it did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.03,0:13:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If this continues, we'll be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You too are our only hope. We'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do\Nto stop this giant monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,These three dragons once served\Nas the protectors of my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They defeated the great beast 10,000\Nyears ago when it first appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But for this, they paid a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're frozen in time, unable to\Ndefend my dominion as they did so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can we help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the legend states that\Nthree brave warriors will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,awaken these dragons when\Nthey are needed again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh i believe that one of these\Nwarriors is you and if i'm correct
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be able to remove that sword\Nfrom the ice and what will happen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're wrong i'm not wrong i know\Nthat you once saved egypt from the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow games and i believe you can\Ndo the same for us ready yugi yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, did it work or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've released Timaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, according to the prophecy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you and Timaeus will become linked\Ntogether as soon as you call his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Timaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:15:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel its power surging through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters seem to be\Ntrapped in that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least they're getting weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any idea what that is up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I do, and it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, great Leviathan, time to show the\NPharaoh what true power is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, guys, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that dragon we released!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Timaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaeus, protect us from that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.31,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Beast is still weak,\Nso he retreated for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that, my companions and\NI are truly grateful, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But many of us remain\Nprisoners on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Beast will return\Nagain, and his power will grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped before\Nhe is fully restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like Timaeus is\Nstrong, but not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We must release the other two dragons.
